  },
  "gaps": [
    "the dispatcher block counter must be exposed for OM_DISPATCH_BLOCK_COUNT"
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Every path is empty on purpose: run `python3 cli.py discover --target smol-gpu --rtl <checkout>` to resolve the probes against your elaborated RTL, then `cli.py doctor`.",
